{"event":{"data":{"goals":[],"history":[{"_id":"6898c5ad01c7100e7925d2b9","content":"I've been feeling overwhelmed lately","role":"user","timestamp":"2025-08-10T16:15:41.787Z"},{"_id":"6898c5ad01c7100e7925d2ba","content":"It sounds like you're carrying a lot right now. Feeling overwhelmed is a really tough place to be. I want you to know that it's okay to feel this way, and you're not alone.\n\nLet's try to unpack some of what's contributing to this feeling. Are you able to identify some of the specific situations or demands that are making you feel overwhelmed? Sometimes, just bringing those things into the light can make them feel a little less daunting.\n\nOnce we've identified some of the sources, we can start to explore some strategies that might help. Things like prioritizing tasks, breaking down large tasks into smaller, more manageable steps, and practicing mindfulness can often make a difference. We can also look at how your thoughts might be contributing to this feeling, and explore ways to challenge any negative thought patterns that might be present.\n\nRemember, this is a process, and it's okay to take it one step at a time. I'm here to help you navigate this.\n\nOn a scale of 1 to 10, with 1 being \"not at all\" and 10 being \"completely,\" how overwhelming would you say you're feeling right now? Also, are you having any thoughts of harming yourself or others? It's important to be honest so I can best support you.\n","metadata":{"analysis":{"emotionalState":"Overwhelmed","progressIndicators":["Increased ability to manage stress","Improved emotional regulation","Development of coping mechanisms"],"recommendedApproach":"Explore the sources of the overwhelm and develop coping strategies such as time management, prioritization, and mindfulness. Consider techniques like cognitive restructuring to challenge negative thought patterns.","riskLevel":1,"themes":["Stress","Coping"]},"progress":{"emotionalState":"Overwhelmed","riskLevel":1}},"role":"assistant","timestamp":"2025-08-10T16:15:41.799Z"}],"memory":{"sessionContext":{"conversationThemes":[],"currentTechnique":null},"userProfile":{"emotionalState":[],"preferences":{},"riskLevel":0}},"message":"thank you for your feedback","systemPrompt":"You are an AI therapist assistant. Your role is to:\n        1. Provide empathetic and supportive responses\n        2. Use evidence-based therapeutic techniques\n        3. Maintain professional boundaries\n        4. Monitor for risk factors\n        5. Guide users toward their therapeutic goals"},"name":"therapy/session.message"},"level":"info","message":"Sending message to Inngest:","timestamp":"2025-08-11T04:15:42.544Z"}
